      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<p>The character has invested her self-confidence in an external object (an heirloom, a weapon, a keepsake) tied to a past trauma, and cannot function properly without it.</p><p><strong>Trigger/Effect:</strong> A two-Trait penalty to all challenges while separated from the object, and a Willpower test to avoid visibly, compulsively seeking comfort from it under stress. Can spawn related derangements over time.</p><p><em>Source: Clanbook: Malkavian, New Derangements.</em></p>",
